            "intro": "A few helpful details before you reach out. If your question is not here, just get in touch.",
            "items": [
              {
                "question": "How do you charge for your services?",
                "answer": "We offer three structures — hourly, fixed-fee, and retainer — depending on the matter. Every engagement begins with a written fee agreement so you know the cost upfront."
              },
              {
                "question": "Do you offer a free initial consultation?",
                "answer": "Yes. The first consultation is a confidential conversation to understand your matter and whether we can help."
              },
              {
                "question": "Is my inquiry confidential?",
                "answer": "We treat all inquiries with discretion. Note that a formal attorney-client relationship is established only after we agree to take your matter."
              },
              {
                "question": "What areas of law do you practice?",
                "answer": "We focus on business law, real estate, and estate planning. This focused approach lets us provide deep, practical counsel."
              },
              {
                "question": "How quickly will I hear back?",
                "answer": "We aim to respond to all inquiries within one business day."
              },
              {
                "question": "Do you handle matters outside your practice areas?",
                "answer": "We keep our practice focused. If your matter falls outside our expertise, we will help you find the right counsel."
              }
            ]
          }
        }
